    <item>
      <title>Become a member</title>
      <link>https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/membership/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/membership/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 d-flex justify-content-center row&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 col-md-1 my-auto img-row-div&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;img class=&#34;img-fluid d-block&#34;src=&#34;https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/img/icons/subtitle_1.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 col-md-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h5 class=&#34;card-title&#34;&gt;First step&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p class=&#34;card-text&#34;&gt;&#xA;                Send in an application of membership. &lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://forms.gle/LbhjWo1TQEXmbcJc8&#34;&gt;Follow the steps in the application form&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 d-flex justify-content-center row&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 col-md-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h5 class=&#34;card-title&#34;&gt;Second step&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p class=&#34;card-text&#34;&gt;Enroll in our Canvas &amp; log into Skedda. &lt;br&gt; Click the links below to enroll with your SSO account. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chalmers.instructure.com/enroll/8AGEM6&#34;&gt; Go to Chalmers FUSE Canvas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chalmersfuse.skedda.com&#34;&gt; Go to Skedda&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 col-md-1 my-auto img-row-div&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;img class=&#34;img-fluid d-block&#34; src=&#34;https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/img/icons/subtitle_2.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 d-flex justify-content-center row&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 col-md-1 my-auto img-row-div&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;img class=&#34;img-fluid d-block&#34;src=&#34;https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/img/icons/subtitle_3.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;p-2 col-md-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h5 class=&#34;card-title&#34;&gt;Third step&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p class=&#34;card-text&#34;&gt;&#xA;                Attend a safety walk-through. &lt;br&gt; Safety walk-throughs are held by T-RAX board members&lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;on Wednesday, safety walk-throughs starts 17:30 outside our office&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Once the safety walk-through is completed you are allowed in &lt;br&gt; T-RAX common areas &amp; study rooms. &lt;br&gt; (&lt;i&gt;Congratulations you are now a member!&lt;/i&gt;🥳)&#xA;            &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
