    <item>
      <title>FAQ</title>
      <link>https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/faq/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://trax.chs.chalmers.se/faq/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 class=&#34;col-md-12&#34;&gt;How do I become a member? &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;lead mb-4&#34;&gt;To Become a member you can follow the steps on the page Become a member &lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://trax.chs.chalmers.se/membership&#34;&gt; Become a member here. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 class=&#34;col-md-12&#34;&gt;Where can I find the canvas?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;lead mb-4&#34;&gt;Here is the link to our canvas site. &lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chalmers.instructure.com/enroll/8AGEM6&#34;&gt; Go to Chalmers FUSE Canvas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 class=&#34;col-md-12&#34;&gt;I want to renew my membership for this academic year?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;lead mb-4&#34;&gt; Step One: &lt;br&gt; A new application needs to be sent in every year. Follow the steps in the application form. &lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://forms.gle/N4z5FHXTszMQuJgE8&#34;&gt;Follow the steps in the application form&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt; Step Two: &lt;br&gt; Pay for membership (100SEK per study year) during open hours at the T-RAX office. Opening hours can be found in the bottom of this page.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
